    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data Transformation\n\n**WHAT IT DOES:**\n* Processes arrays and objects from previous nodes\n* Performs calculations: sum, average, count, filter\n* Uses JavaScript expressions for complex logic\n* Reshapes data for downstream nodes\n\n**COMMON OPERATIONS:**\n* `.reduce()` - Calculate totals\n* `.filter()` - Select specific items\n* `.map()` - Transform each item\n* `.length` - Count items\n\n**USE CASES:**\n* Financial calculations and reconciliation\n* Data validation before processing\n* Aggregating metrics for reporting\n* Filtering records by criteria\n\n**REFERENCE**\nhttps://docs.n8n.io/code/builtin/data-transformation-functions/",
        "height": 532,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7b20fdf9-16dd-468b-a1a4-b73478c75489",
      "name": "Concept",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        432,
        144
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Example\n\n**REDUCE FOR SUM:**\n```javascript\n$json.transactions.reduce(\n  (sum, t) => sum + t.amount, 0\n)\n```\n* Iterates through array\n* Accumulates sum starting at 0\n\n**FILTER FOR CONDITION:**\n```javascript\n$json.transactions.filter(\n  t => t.type === 'credit'\n)\n```\n* Returns only matching items\n* Use `.length` to count results\n\n**ARRAY ACCESS:**\n`$json.transactions` - Access array\n`t.amount`, `t.type`, etc. - Access property in loop",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "13249110-e76c-48a6-b2f1-f0c86ee1211d",
      "name": "Example Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        832,
        144
